### create a new User
POST https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/user HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{

"email": "joe5s34@mail.com",
"name": "12345678",
 "authProviders": [
    { "provider": "google", "provider_id": "12345" },
    { "provider": "github", "provider_id": "67890" }
  ]
}

### get a user by id
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/user/id/2?relations=authProviders HTTP/1.1

### get list of databases
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/list HTTP/1.1

### get list of entities in a specific database
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/list HTTP/1.1

### get entities in a specific database
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/user HTTP/1.1

### get entities in a specific database with relations
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/user?relations=authProviders&filters={"id":"5"}&filters={"role":"user"}&limit=10&offset=0 HTTP/1.1

### get entities in a specific database with relations
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/user?relations=authProviders&filters=%7B%22id%22%3A%225%22%7D&filters=%7B%22role%22%3A%22user%22%7D&limit=10&offset=0 HTTP/1.1

